      "description": "Training | Catawba College Skip Main Navigation Search Your Catawba Your Catawba Future Students Current Students Alumni & Friends Parents & Families Community Faculty & Staff Menu Apply Request Info Visit Give Catawba College You are here: Home Admission & Aid Online Training Career Training Programs Career Training Programs Catawba College, in partnership with ed2go, offers online open enrollment programs designed to provide the skills necessary to acquire professional level positions for many in-demand occupations. Our programs are designed by a team of professionals from each respective field, providing you with effective web-based learning programs. Instructors/mentors are actively involved in your online learning experience, responding to any questions or concerns, as well as encouraging and motivating you to succeed. Browse our featured course offerings by category below or view our full catalog : Featured Course Offerings Computer Science & Applications Bookkeeping and QuickBooks Artificial Intelligence for Business Health & Fitness EKG Technician Certification Clinical Medical Assistant Certification Phlebotomy Technician Certification Professional Life Coach Certification Medical Billing & Coding Specialist Certification Information Technology CompTIA Certification Cybersecurity Boot Camp Teacher Professional Development TEFL Certification View Full Catalog of Offerings Apply Request Info Visit Give Social Facebook X Youtube Instagram Snapchat Address 2300 W Innes St Salisbury, NC 28144 Phone home 1.800.CATAWBA Utility Main People Directory Employment Opportunities Box Office Bookstore Sustainability Footer Main Maps & Directions Giving Back Safety Information Contact Us Footer Main Accessibility Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy Policy Title IX Policies © Catawba College Copyright © by Catawba College. All rights reserved.  Catawba College, Catawba Athletics and related trademarks and logos are owned and controlled by Catawba College